Hi Cheong,
We will have the following sp to handle PUKAL process in order to generate reports & files

1.	Side bar (PUKAL Billing Process)

2.	ApiMgmtCustBillingPukal 
	- To allow user to list out PUKAL billing transactions By monthly basis 

	Parameters:-
	@PrgEttyId	bigint,
	@Yr			smallint = NULL,
	@Mn			tinyint = NULL,
	@ColCnt		tinyint OUTPUT,
	@UserId		tUserId = NULL,
	@SrcIpAddr	tIpAddr = NULL,
	@MsgId		tMsgId OUTPUT	

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/sp/ApiMgmtCustBillingPukal/queryasync HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authorization}}
content-type: application/json

{
"PrgEttyId":1,
"Yr":2025,
"Mn":01
}
###


3.	ApiMgmtCustBillingPukalSave
	- To change billing transaction amount of PUKAL transaction if there is required. 
	***It can only be change for those OUTBOUND/ ERROR, REJECTED status only

	Parameters:-
	@PrgEttyId	bigint,
	@PukalId		bigint,
	@AcctId		bigint,
--	@ObjCd		varchar(20),
	@BillAmt		money,
	@UserId		tUserId = NULL,
	@SrcIpAddr	tIpAddr = NULL,
	@MsgId		tMsgId OUTPUT

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/sp/ApiMgmtCustBillingPukalSave/queryasync HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authorization}}
content-type: application/json

{
"PrgEttyId":1,
"Yr":2025,
"Mn":04
}
4.	ApiRptFilePukalRerun
	- To re-run all the reports and re-generate GFM files for re-check details.

	Parameters:-
	@RptType	tRefCd,
	@PId		tPrcsId,
	@RunId		bigint,
	@UserId		tUserId = NULL,
	@SrcIpAddr	tSrcIpAddr = NULL,
	@MsgId		tMsgId OUTPUT

5. 	ApiRptFilePukalSave 
	- A button to get user (click twices) to make Final confirmation. Calling this sp to turn the report or file status to "ACTIVE" 

	Parameters:-
	@RptType	tRefCd,
	@PId		tPrcsId,
	@RunId		bigint,
	@UserId		tUserId = NULL,
	@SrcIpAddr	tSrcIpAddr = NULL,
	@MsgId		tMsgId OUTPUT

